        "text": "Monday, January 29, 2024 THE STRAITS TIMES\r\n3\r\n\r\nADVERTORIAL\r\n\r\nAnne Megan Kong, an Anti-Drug\r\nAdvocate, shares how she discovered\r\nher passion for volunteering\r\n\r\nAre you passionate about the anti-drug cause like Megan?\r\nKeen to meet other like-minded individuals? Scan to find\r\nout how you can be an ADA too.\r\n\r\nBROUGHT TO YOU BY\r\n\r\nC\r\n\r\nuriosity led this 20-year-old bookworm\r\nwith a love for crime thrillers on a path of\r\nvolunteering. After reading about the ills\r\nof drug abuse, she signed up as an Anti-Drug\r\nAdvocate (ADA) to share the anti-drug message\r\nwith her peers. Read on to learn what Megan\r\ndoes as an ADA!\r\n\r\n",
