        "text": "future\r\n\r\nI’ve always loved reading.\r\nSome stories I’ve read showed\r\nthe harms that drug abuse\r\ncan cause on a person and\r\ntheir loved ones. This inspired\r\nme to sign up as an ADA.\r\n\r\nInternational Day\r\nAgainst Drug Abuse\r\nand Illicit Trafficking\r\nfalls on every June 26.\r\nOn this day, the city\r\nlights up in the colours\r\nof the anti-drug ribbon,\r\nwhich makes me feel\r\nproud to support the\r\n#DrugFreeSG cause.\r\n\r\nMeeting new people is my favourite part! It’s\r\na fulfilling experience to share with others\r\nthe importance of leading a drug-free life.\r\n\r\nin the\r\ncharacter\r\ndrug-free\r\n\r\nFind your\r\n\r\nWhen a friend is stressed, I always\r\nlend a listening ear. I help them\r\ncome up with other ways to feel\r\nbetter and make the right choices.\r\n\r\n",
